PGEN 1:1
MIn the beginning God created the heaven and the earth.
T0.00
^
D05/04/26
PGEN 1:2
MAnd the earth was without form, and void; and darkness was upon the face of the deep. And the Spirit of God moved upon the face of the waters.
T0.00
^
D05/04/26
PGEN 1:3
MAnd God said, Let there be light: and there was light.
T0.00
^
D05/04/26
PGEN 1:4
MAnd God saw the light, that it was good: and God divided the light from the darkness.
T0.00
^
D05/04/26
PGEN 1:5
