MAnd God said, Let there be a firmament in the midst of the waters, and let it divide the waters from the waters.
T0.00
^
D05/04/26
PGEN 1:7
MAnd God made the firmament, and divided the waters which were under the firmament from the waters which were above the firmament: and it was so.
T0.00
^
D05/04/26
PGEN 1:8
MAnd God called the firmament Heaven. And the evening and the morning were the second day.
T0.00
^
D05/04/26
