MAnd God said, Let the waters under the heaven be gathered together unto one place, and let the dry land appear: and it was so.
T0.00
^
D05/04/26
PGEN 1:10
MAnd God called the dry land Earth; and the gathering together of the waters called he Seas: and God saw that it was good.
T0.00
^
D05/04/26
PGEN 1:11
MAnd God said, Let the earth bring forth grass, the herb yielding seed, and the fruit tree yielding fruit after his kind, whose seed is in itself, upon the earth: and it was so.
T0.00
^
D05/04/26
PGEN 1:12
MAnd the earth brought forth grass, and herb yielding seed after his kind, and the tree yielding fruit, whose seed was in itself, after his kind: and God saw that it was good.
T0.00
^
D05/04/26
PGEN 1:13
MAnd the evening and the morning were the third day.
T0.00
^
D05/04/26
PGEN 1:14
